WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Ground. Name the case and trace what the report actually contributes.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Question. Use six perspectives plus the project's purple synthesis extension.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Discuss. Turn the table into a workshop agenda that invites disagreement.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Act. Assign who will verify a claim and what evidence would change the decision.
